handled by a language-specific
    42   *       {@code I18NBundle}.
    43   *   <li>The second level contains changes between different countries 
that use the same language.
    44   *       Only the differences between a country and the country of the 
language bundle need to be
    45   *       handled by a country-specific {@code I18NBundle}.
    46   *   <li>The third level contains changes that don't have a geographic 
reason (e.g. changes that
    47   *       where made at some point in time like {@code PREEURO} where the
currency of come countries
    48   *       changed. The country bundle would return the current currency 
